IShoppingMallInventoryAlert.IRequest.description:
Search parameters for filtering inventory alerts by type, status, time range, and seller.

Used in pagination operations to retrieve filtered inventory alerts based on specific criteria.

Supports filtering by alert_type (low_stock/critical_stock/back_in_stock), status (active/cleared), seller_id, and date ranges for alerted_at.

Does NOT include parameters for pagination (page/limit) as those are handled by the IPage wrapper.

